{"seq":1,"slug":"game-engine-fundamentals","title":"游戏引擎基础","stage":"DONE","category":"game-development","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-engine-fundamentals","rating":{"composite":4.01,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.43,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 游戏引擎基础 简介\n\n游戏引擎是支撑现代游戏开发的核心基础设施，它将图形渲染、物理模拟、音频处理、输入管理等复杂子系统整合为一个统一的开发框架。理解游戏引擎的内部架构和运行机制，是从\"使用引擎\"迈向\"驾驭引擎\"的关键一步。\n\n本知识库适用于有一定编程基础、希望深入理解游戏引擎底层原理的开发者。无论你是想从零构建一个简易引擎，还是想更好地理解 Unity、Unreal 等商业引擎的设计思路，这里的内容都将为你提供系统化的知识框架。\n\n第1章**引擎架构总览**从宏观视角剖析游戏引擎的整体结构，包括引擎的分层设计、子系统划分、平台抽象层以及插件化扩展机制，帮助你建立对引擎全貌的认知。\n\n第2章**游戏循环与时序控制**深入探讨游戏运行的心跳机制，涵盖主循环模式的设计、固定时间步与可变时间步的取舍、帧率控制策略以及时间管理系统，这些是保障游戏流畅运行的底层支柱。\n\n第3章**场景与实体管理**聚焦于游戏世界中对象的组织方式，从传统场景图到现代 ECS 架构，再到对象生命周期管理和空间分区技术，系统讲解如何高效管理成千上万的游戏实体。\n\n第4章**资源管理系统**讲解游戏资源从制作到运行时加载的完整流水线，包括资产管线设计、内存管理策略、序列化方案以及流式加载技术，掌握这些才能让游戏在有限硬件资源下高效运转。\n\n第5章**脚本系统与热重载**探索如何为引擎赋予灵活的扩展能力，涵盖脚本语言集成、可视化脚本方案、热重载机制以及调试工具的设计，让开发者能够快速迭代游戏逻辑。\n\n推荐学习路径：建议从第1章开始建立全局视角，然后依次学习第2章和第3章掌握引擎运行时的核心机制，再通过第4章理解资源流转，最后学习第5章了解如何提升开发效率。如果你已有引擎使用经验，也可以根据自己的薄弱环节选择性阅读。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"engine-architecture","title":"引擎架构总览","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-engine-fundamentals/engine-architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"engine-overview","title":"游戏引擎架构概述","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-engine-fundamentals/engine-architecture/engine-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"subsystem-design","title":"引擎子系统设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-engine-fundamentals/engine-architecture/subsystem-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"platform-abstraction","title":"平台抽象层设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-engine-fundamentals/engine-architecture/platform-abstraction"},{"seq":4,"slug":"plugin-architecture","title":"插件式架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-engine-fundamentals/engine-architecture/plugin-architecture"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"game-loop-and-timing","title":"游戏循环与时序控制","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-engine-fundamentals/game-loop-and-timing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"game-loop-patterns","title":"游戏循环模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-engine-fundamentals/game-loop-and-timing/game-loop-patterns"},{"seq":2,"slug":"fixed-vs-variable-timestep","title":"固定与可变时间步对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-engine-fundamentals/game-loop-and-timing/fixed-vs-variable-timestep"},{"seq":3,"slug":"frame-rate-control","title":"帧率控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-engine-fundamentals/game-loop-and-timing/frame-rate-control"},{"seq":4,"slug":"time-management","title":"时间管理系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-engine-fundamentals/game-loop-and-timing/time-management"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"scene-and-entity","title":"场景与实体管理","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-engine-fundamentals/scene-and-entity","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"scene-graph","title":"场景图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-engine-fundamentals/scene-and-entity/scene-graph"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ecs-pattern","title":"实体组件系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-engine-fundamentals/scene-and-entity/ecs-pattern"},{"seq":3,"slug":"object-lifecycle","title":"对象生命周期管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-engine-fundamentals/scene-and-entity/object-lifecycle"},{"seq":4,"slug":"spatial-partitioning","title":"空间分区","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-engine-fundamentals/scene-and-entity/spatial-partitioning"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"resource-management","title":"资源管理系统","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-engine-fundamentals/resource-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"asset-pipeline","title":"资源管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-engine-fundamentals/resource-management/asset-pipeline"},{"seq":2,"slug":"memory-management","title":"内存管理","url":